## Family 3: EAR TPP

**Honest assessment:** I am NOT confident enough in the exact current EAR/ECCN 3A090 formula definitions and threshold values to produce reliable test vectors. The regulation has been updated multiple times since October 2022, and the specific definitions of "adjusted peak performance," the bit-width aggregation rules, and the current threshold values are details I could easily get wrong.

What I can state with moderate confidence:
- TPP involves aggregating peak computational performance across all chips in an IC package
- The performance density formula divides TPP by die area
- The thresholds have been revised since the initial rule

Rather than produce vectors with potentially wrong formulas or outdated thresholds, I'd recommend checking the current Bureau of Industry and Security (BIS) Federal Register notices for the authoritative definitions. If you can share the current formula text, I can work through the arithmetic reliably.

